    "raw": "---\nid: \"who-is-he\"\ntitle: \"Who is He\"\nalt_title: \"\"\nyear: 2013\ncamp: \"CCM13: Be One\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"John 17:21 • 1 Corinthians 10:4\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics: Arian Prabowo • Music: Yonatan Pranata\"\nlyricists: \"Arian Prabowo\"\ncomposers: \"Yonatan Pranata\"\nperformers: \"Sounds of Joy (POJ Melbourne)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified in CCM13 song v08 & official Sounds of Joy YouTube description.\"\nkey: \"G\"\nkey_verified: false\nkey_note: \"\"\nchord_status: \"lyrics-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PyK_iTo9zXE\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"Who is He — CCM13 Studio Recording (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/2013-who-is-he.mp3\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2dMoFcEHcw_dUxNQ2FLRHZNaGs/view?usp=drivesdk&resourcekey=0-JUefN95V-LVrMK03SZPRzA\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM13 Lyrics Doc (v08)\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13Dg2CRjSv9SlSFnU39R5jwWfxFRsu2fAtUktxkZzzJI/edit\"\n---\n\n## Verse 1\nWho is he\nThat rain bread from heaven\nand draw a river from a stone\nIn the midst of the desert\n\n## Verse 2\nWho is he\nWho said take my body\nAnd pour out his blood\nunto remission of sins\n\n## Pre-Chorus\nHe is the mighty\nWho fell on his knees\nFor the lame and the chained\n\nHe is the holy\nWho was crucified\nTo redeem the dead\n\n## Chorus\nImmanuel, The Messiah\nJesus The Christ, The Lamb of God\nWho takes away, the sin of the world\nImmanuel, the Messiah\n\n## Bridge\nThe shepherd who guides us\nto living water\nwiping away every tears\nThe father who founds us\nAnd call us his own\nI wanna know, Who he is\n"
