    "raw": "---\nid: \"let-go-let-god\"\ntitle: \"Let Go, Let God\"\nalt_title: \"\"\nyear: 2014\ncamp: \"CCM14: Let Go, Let God\"\nlanguage: \"English\"\nscripture: \"John 14:12–14 • 1 Corinthians 2:9\"\ncredits: \"Lyrics & Music: Michelle Setiawan & Yonatan Pranata\"\nlyricists: \"Michelle Setiawan & Yonatan Pranata\"\ncomposers: \"Michelle Setiawan & Yonatan Pranata\"\nperformers: \"Sounds of Joy (POJ Melbourne)\"\ncredit_note: \"Verified on official Sounds of Joy YouTube release.\"\nkey: \"G\"\nkey_verified: false\nkey_note: \"\"\nchord_status: \"lyrics-archived\"\nyoutube_url: \"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aoco0Tj75jw\"\ncontact: \"arian.prabowo@placeofjoy.org.au\"\naudio_files:\n  - label: \"Let Go, Let God — Studio Mix (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/2014-let-go-let-god.mp3\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8jnuXx6MBRPdVI2VXBoVk11cHc/view?usp=drivesdk&resourcekey=0-wmWYzC6TCWI9gI-lh4n38g\"\n  - label: \"Let Go, Let God — Alternate Mix v3 (MP3)\"\n    path: \"audio/2014-let-go-let-god-v3.mp3\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B8jnuXx6MBRPNm1vRURXUW41V2s/view?usp=drivesdk&resourcekey=0-YLCklM2Q1D_rtHb6F263ig\"\n  - label: \"Let Go, Let God — Minus Vox Rough Mix (14.9 MB Drive Stream)\"\n    path: \"\"\n    drive_url: \"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1YZZegwV9aVV_rOMFQ89OnQJ7mxbcQHew/view?usp=drivesdk\"\ndrive_links:\n  - label: \"CCM14 Lyrics Doc\"\n    url: \"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1nLRJE9Is6NYXycv34E4yyCgSMoyDq8bqjdmSdIR4TYs/edit\"\n---\n\n## Verse 1\nThere are nights when all I can do is cry\nwhen tomorrow seems so far away\nand as I rise up my hands to you\nI see your helping hand on the way\n\n## Verse 2\nThere are days where I call upon your name\nBut I cant hear your voice\nAnd as I lay my crown at your feet\nI patiently await for you\n\n## Chorus\nLet go and let God, I surrender my life\nAt the foot of the cross, I lay it all down\nLet you change my heart, from the inside out\n\nWhat no eye has seen, and no ear has heard\nand no human mind has conceived\nGood are all His plans, for those whose heart are set on Him\n\n## Bridge\nI trust in your unfailing love\nin You I find my strength\nAnd I will sing your praises forever\nFor you have been good to me\n"
